-- C18 example: in-run hydraulic-fracture growth (LEFM).
-- A 200 m vertical fracture trace (HFRAC F1) is the maximum extent; 25 m wings are open at the start.
-- HFGROW F1  K_IC = 1 MPa m^0.5, sigma_min = 340 bar, no gradient, initial half-length 20 m.
-- Water injection at 2 sm3/d: the fracture pressure climbs to sigma_min + K_IC/sqrt(pi H/2) (~342.5 bar) and the
-- wings grow piece by piece (run log: 'fracture F1 wing + grows to ...'; Results: cell array HFOPEN).
